{
  "Serilog": {
    "MinimumLevel": {
      "Default": "Debug",
      "Override": {
        "Microsoft.AspNetCore": "Information"
      }
    }
  },
  "OpenTelemetry": {
    "OtlpEndpoint": "http://localhost:4317"
  },
  "ConnectionStrings": {
    "HostCatalog": "Server=localhost,1433;Database=DealerFOSS_Host;User Id=sa;Password=Your_dev_password_here;TrustServerCertificate=True;Encrypt=True"
  },

  "//Seed": [
    "Enabled creates two sample dealerships with a handful of records each —",
    "enough to sign in and see every screen working.",
    "",
    "Demo fills them out: around 480 customers, 210 cars across every stock",
    "state, 140 enquiries, 90 deals from draft to delivered with tax, and 160",
    "repair orders, spread over three months so the dashboard has a previous",
    "month to compare against. Deliveries and invoices go through the real",
    "services, so the ledger balances because the application balanced it.",
    "",
    "Leave Demo off if you are running the test suite or verify-e2e: both assert",
    "against the small set. It is deterministic and idempotent, so turning it on",
    "later gives the same dealership and running twice changes nothing."
  ],
  "Seed": {
    "Enabled": true,
    "Demo": false
  },

  "//Secrets": [
    "Encrypts tenant connection strings at rest. Leave this out in Development and",
    "the application uses a pass-through instead — convenient locally, and it",
    "refuses to start in any other environment.",
    "",
    "Add it and you exercise the real thing. Generate a key with:",
    "  $b = New-Object byte[] 32",
    "  [System.Security.Cryptography.RandomNumberGenerator]::Fill($b)",
    "  [Convert]::ToBase64String($b)",
    "",
    "The key id is yours to choose; a year-month reads well because it says when",
    "the key was cut. Keep old keys listed after rotating or values written under",
    "them become unreadable. NEVER commit a real key — this file is git-ignored."
  ],
  "Secrets": {
    "CurrentKeyId": "2026-07",
    "Keys": {
      "2026-07": "REPLACE_WITH_A_BASE64_32_BYTE_KEY"
    }
  }
}
